  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Yadem Tekstil Company - Sukuk Financing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Sukuk_based funding for the project is to be through two operations: (i) The Purchase and Leaseback of part of Yadem&apos;s existing plant equipment, which was inspected and identified by the due diligence mission during the visit to Yadem&apos;s manufacturing facilities; and (ii) Direct Lease financing for the purchase and installation of a new Spinning Mill.</narrative>
  </description>
